  "testNames": [
    "actual contextv7 preparation and sixth validation keep one hash-only result through checkpoint DATA",
    "both allowed post-signer price advances retain original ACK nonce hash and signature",
    "a fifth-cycle horizon expiry keeps signed DATA without another signer or material entry",
    "sixth-cycle expiry refuses pre-custody validation while preserving the original encoded packet",
    "a moved sixth-cycle account frontier refuses without rebuilding or resigning",
    "insufficient sixth-cycle balance refuses before a second material or key operation",
    "changed sixth-cycle runtime pricing parameters cannot refresh the original candidate",
    "a pending hash-only callback holds original ownership without fifth-cycle reads or reentry",
    "a pending sixth current read retains one original and refuses competing operations",
    "a mismatching borrowed owner address stops before any account quote material or signer work",
    "a rejected borrowed callback leaves the retained adapter original unknown without automatic retry",
    "captured configuration detaches work bounds and public selection while retaining borrowed identities",
    "new and legacy configuration grammars stay distinct and reject extra factories or accessor callbacks",
    "a material deadline cannot resume preparation or signer entry on late fulfillment"
  ],
